1449", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619145_1482209849624782_2953575631843583094_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=oLFreFMCjBoQ7kNvwEjS9uY&_nc_oc=Adr9bjnFqkLdGRiSMUJ2Ixj7F_3Rd-SyZeVjpQV2C_W6gzFwcYXhDhc9DlftBH40lKA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af_YztKzVF9PngH2J7Fo5KhrKP6dG2oZTA0mME8K5I--1A&oe=6A2ACDD1"}, {"file_name": "screenshot4.png", "id": "1307147150753149", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619681_1307147154086482_3092090264023794624_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=88iVf-O_FhEQ7kNvwFTRwz1&_nc_oc=Ado13sV4_SZidBELI5p9wRiGgkeHm6hIsh8jn8Z3ARMY9CGNzPniyD5xYEc1YYoP0eA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af9YpkiKheR_ug-s3x4_wXPOtah2tw_hj2T9PaEse5031Q&oe=6A2AE111"}, {"file_name": "screenshot.png", "id": "1087082782807722", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618920_1087082789474388_6834342829567925464_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=IWxxdAlSmE4Q7kNvwGAwRuR&_nc_oc=Adrkuc4-2I8exX7OEfvf70FA7bRw9ludoHdwLGbJgoj2Uwjd0b_lFZ50oqNfG_07GxA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af8-ZKAAUSDhfT0tIjtoY7ZEicqOMfxOY8SP0Obhp_lhTg&oe=6A2AB772"}, {"file_name": "screenshot5.png", "id": "1576468597024644", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619588_1576468600357977_963030132674722656_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Rpo5xgFR01oQ7kNvwGGqJ8H&_nc_oc=Adr_1S7i7SwJD6HAQ8A_lKBaZKcBPMSJFcklITLSnkZ1tztsyfi4mdYySpH1TxSOB_c&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af8CcaZMTVC3Ob7T3U-npCqNIS3_aIQllWzF1_NWlRqsVw&oe=6A2ABDB8"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Landscap32_2560x1440_shoko.png", "id": "1450279846165373", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618065_1450279849498706_5641516501206576537_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=8URFEr1c4DMQ7kNvwF5jK4c&_nc_oc=Adol0_b_2deY8wXH75KZC1-WkLHYadgZXvEitngwcIHgnM9RXWEn37MBpw_Hlv9Y0-8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af9xIt73tPbcB2WgYv3JOFCPuh8Lga2uUWHEbZE36UBFeg&oe=6A2AD95F"}, "display_name": "Street Simulator Z: Multiplayer", "keywords": ["Gang", "Survival", "Cooking", "Fight", "Gun"], "long_description": "\n Street Simulator Z: Multiplayer is the laugh-out-loud VR adventure where you and your friends (up to 4 players \u2013 insert player count) team up to flip your fortunes.\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\n{1105387631512705}\n\n\n Grow exotic herbs, cook up amazing (and maybe bizarre) dishes, take down any troublemakers who get in your way, and hustle your way from zero to hero.\n{1401990557573965}\n Earn serious cash, upgrade your gear, and show everyone who's truly running things! All in immersive Meta Quest VR.\n\nKEY FEATURES:\n\n\ud83e\udd1d SQUAD GOALS! HILARIOUS CO-OP MULTIPLAYER\n\n\u2694\ufe0f PAYBACK TIME! TAKE DOWN THOSE ANNOYING FOES\n\n\ud83c\udf3f\ud83c\udf72 FROM HERB GARDEN TO GOURMET (OR NOT)! GROW, COOK, PROFIT!!!\n\n\ud83d\udcb0 RISE FROM RAGS TO RICHES! EARN BIG & LIVE LARGE\n\n   \n\nREADY TO STIR UP SOME TROUBLE (AND GET PAID FOR IT)?\n\nJump into Street Simulator Z: Multiplayer, call your squad, and start your wild journey from nobody to a notorious (and wealthy) legend!\n\n\n", "short_description": "Life in this town can be a drag, especially with all these annoying jerks causing trouble! "}]}, "developer_name": "Storay Studio", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://newstory-inc.com/privacypo